    "historical": "Recorded pr-working head 6533e444fa37552927070cc8d8190907fd3b413e with four unrelated modifications. Each assigned historical source equals its corresponding Git-head file and f82 transport object individually. f82 is transport, not the project revision.",
    "delta": "Definition and reflection match 6533 and 95e byte-for-byte; compute_shader changes native validation scope selection from old blocking_validation boolean to current ValidationObservation.start_scope. Original role2632 was 1\u2013135; historical 136\u2013138 was independently displayed as support only.",
    "p16": "The separate dirty P16 snapshot is based on a120, not a commit. Later tracked-patch bytes match the recorded SHA256 fc9002ab1135a438f68eede9217f67d22ef737d2c6938509e6e6660f2fc5b7f7; match does not prove original diff invocation or uninterrupted custody, and seven untracked files remain separate. No P16 evidence becomes checkpoint3821.",
